/T (The material in this guide will discuss sexual violence and other difficult topics related to the Title IX process. As you read this guide and undertake this process, please take breaks and be mindful of your emotional and mental health needs. Make sure to identify the resources available to you, as well as the support systems, both formal and informal, in your life. )
