/T (If you choose to file a formal complaint, the Title IX office will prepare the formal complaint and provide the Respondent with official notice that will include a summary of your complaint. Your school should inform you of resources and accommodations that you may receive as part of the process. As noted above, you are still entitled to request accommodations even if you decide not to file a formal complaint. )
/E (If you choose to file a formal complaint, the Title IX office will prepare the formal complaint and provide the Respondent with official notice that will include a summary of your complaint. Your school should inform you of resources and accommodations that you may receive as part of the process. As noted above, you are still entitled to request accommodations even if you decide not to file a formal complaint. )
/Pg 19 0 R
