/T (Separately from the Title IX process, you have the option to file a civil lawsuit against another student or faculty member who sexually assaulted you, and you have the option to file a civil lawsuit against the school itself provided the school failed to meet certain legal duties for you. When considering your legal options, you should check in with yourself to figure out what feels like the safest and most supportive option for you before you decide to move forward. You also should discuss with an attorney your potential claims and options for filing a lawsuit.)
/E (Separately from the Title IX process, you have the option to file a civil lawsuit against another student or faculty member who sexually assaulted you, and you have the option to file a civil lawsuit against the school itself provided the school failed to meet certain legal duties for you. When considering your legal options, you should check in with yourself to figure out what feels like the safest and most supportive option for you before you decide to move forward. You also should discuss with an attorney your potential claims and options for filing a lawsuit.)
